{
  "_note": "关注看板(42 · 338×158):一句结论 + 关注服务的状态格。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FAF8FE\\,#F4F0FE)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#19191F\\,#1E1B28)@90",
        "id": "bg"
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{brand.y}+({brand.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#7A4FD8|#B49BFF",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "id": "srcdot",
        "_note": "源色身份点(本包紫,刻意避开五档状态色)。y 锚在标题的实测框上,不写常量。"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-87pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.brand}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "id": "brand"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-60pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "46pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "id": "at",
        "_note": "时间锚 = 这次检查的时刻(取数那一刻)。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${n},__none__),__none__),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "38.9pt",
            "w": "200pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "15pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "id": "hd"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${n},-1),0),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "33pt",
            "w": "200pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.hNone}",
            "fontSize": "15pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "id": "hd"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(and::(gt::(${n},0),eq::(${nIss},0)),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "33pt",
            "w": "200pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.hAll}",
            "fontSize": "15pt",
            "textColor": "#1E9E62|#3DD68C",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "id": "hd"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(gt::(${nBad},0),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "33pt",
            "w": "200pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.hBadPre}${nBad}${@i18n.hBadSuf}",
            "fontSize": "15pt",
            "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${headLv},-9),0),#1E9E62|#3DD68C,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${headLv},-9),1),#2F6FDB|#6EA8FE,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${headLv},-9),2),#A86E00|#E8B339,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${headLv},-9),3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${headLv},-9),4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,#6B7280|#8E939B)))))]",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "id": "hd"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${nBad},0),gt::(${nMaint},0)),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "33pt",
            "w": "200pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.hMaintPre}${nMaint}${@i18n.hMaintSuf}",
            "fontSize": "15pt",
            "textColor": "#2F6FDB|#6EA8FE",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "id": "hd"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${nBad},0),eq::(${nMaint},0),gt::(${nUnk},0)),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "33pt",
            "w": "200pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.hUnkPre}${nUnk}${@i18n.hUnkSuf}",
            "fontSize": "15pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "id": "hd"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-134pt",
        "y": "37pt",
        "w": "120pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.wPre}${n}${@i18n.wSuf}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "id": "wsub",
        "hide": "$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${n},0),0),0,2)]"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "forEach",
        "props": {
          "items": "${svcs}",
          "key": "_it",
          "index": "_i"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "op",
            "action": "if",
            "props": {
              "val": "$[if::(lt::(${_i},findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),1,0)]"
            },
            "react": [
              {
                "type": "layer",
                "x": "${_it.x}pt",
                "y": "${_it.y}pt",
                "w": "${bw}pt",
                "h": "40pt",
                "bgColor": "#E7E9EE|#20232A",
                "cornerRadius": {
                  "leftT": "10pt",
                  "leftB": "10pt",
                  "rightT": "10pt",
                  "rightB": "10pt"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "layer",
                "x": "${_it.x}pt+11pt",
                "y": "${_it.y}pt+7.5pt",
                "w": "7pt",
                "h": "7pt",
                "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),0),#1E9E62|#3DD68C,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),1),#2F6FDB|#6EA8FE,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),2),#E0A100|#E8B339,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,#6B7280|#8E939B)))))]",
                "cornerRadius": {
                  "leftT": "3.5pt",
                  "leftB": "3.5pt",
                  "rightT": "3.5pt",
                  "rightB": "3.5pt"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "txt",
                "x": "${_it.x}pt+23pt",
                "y": "${_it.y}pt+7pt",
                "w": "${bwn}pt",
                "h": "-1",
                "text": "${_it.n}",
                "fontSize": "11.5pt",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
                "maxLines": "1",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "lineBreak": "0"
              },
              {
                "type": "txt",
                "x": "${_it.x}pt+23pt",
                "y": "${_it.y}pt+24pt",
                "w": "${bwn}pt",
                "h": "-1",
                "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),0),${@i18n.lv0},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),1),${@i18n.lv1},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),2),${@i18n.lv2},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),3),${@i18n.lv3},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),4),${@i18n.lv4},${@i18n.lvU})))))]",
                "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),0),#1E9E62|#3DD68C,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),1),#2F6FDB|#6EA8FE,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),2),#A86E00|#E8B339,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),3),#D9600F|#FF9148,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.l},-9),4),#D93A34|#FF6B61,#6B7280|#8E939B)))))]",
                "maxLines": "1",
                "lineBreak": "0"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "_note": "关注 ≤4 个排两列、5~6 个排三列(格子几何由取数流按关注数算好)。每格:状态点 + 服务名 + 状态词 —— 颜色旁恒有文字。格高 40:名字 y+7 / 状态词 y+24 → 墨迹上下各留 ≈7(v3 是 5 / 9.7);状态点居中于名字那一行(v3 低了 4.5pt)。"
      },
